  "teacher": {
    "levelWhy": "The vocabulary is A1 to A2. The verbs are the challenge: 14 different irregular pasts in short, clear sentences.",
    "notes": "Excellent for irregular past verbs: the chorus lists them in a chant, so repetition does the drilling. The Questions section adds the contrast students usually miss: did + base form (Did you go?) against the past form (Yes, I went). Catalan speakers often say 'Did you went?', so spend time here. The melody is slow and easy; the jumps in L2 and L10 are the only hard moments.",
    "cautions": [
      {
        "line": 4,
        "words": "on my own",
        "severity": "mild",
        "note": "Eating alone can be a sensitive topic for some teenagers. Keep it light."
      }
    ]
  },
